    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_254 :\n    ∀ (A : Set ℕ),\n      (Tendsto (fun x : ℕ ↦ (A ∩ Icc 1 (2 * x)).ncard - (A ∩ Icc 1 x).ncard) atTop atTop) ∧\n      (∀ θ : ℝ, 0 < θ → θ < 1 → ¬ Summable (fun n : A ↦ distToNearestInt (θ * (n : ℝ)))) →\n        ∀ᶠ m in atTop, IsSumOfDistinct A m",
